abstract: >
  Research prototype of a gated multi-layer prompt-injection defense combining
  TF-IDF classical detectors, semantic upgrade, train-only retrieval, ambiguity
  judging, and intent-preserving mitigation, with held-out and ablation evaluation.
keywords:
  - prompt-injection
  - jailbreak-detection
  - llm-security
